<!-- 设置页 -->
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">学习进度</view><view class="stat-line">已完成 {{totalChecked}} / 364 天 · 收藏 {{starredCount}} 个重点词 · 复习记录 {{reviewCount}} 个</view><view class="muted">这是个人版：学习进度只保存在本机，不使用云同步。建议定期导出备份。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">计划开始日期（周一）</view><picker mode="date" value="{{startDate}}" start="2025-01-01" end="2027-12-31" bindchange="onStartDate"><view class="picker-value">{{startDate}}（点击修改）</view></picker><view class="muted" style="margin-top:10rpx;">原计划 2026-09-21 开始。如中途加入或调整，改这里即可。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">朗读语速 {{rateText}}</view><slider min="0.7" max="1.3" step="0.05" value="{{rate}}" activeColor="#176B5B" block-size="24" bindchange="onRate" /><view class="btn-row"><button class="btn-ghost btn-half {{voiceTesting?'btn-voice-on':''}}" bindtap="onTestVoice">{{voiceTesting?'朗读中…（点击停止）':'试听发音'}}</button></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">朗读方式</view><view class="engine-status engine-status--ok">✓ 在线 TTS（个人版）</view><view class="muted">微信个人主体不使用官方同声传译插件，当前统一使用在线英语 TTS。首次朗读需要网络；如无声音，请检查小程序后台 downloadFile 合法域名配置。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">发音口音</view><picker range="{{accentOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{accentIndex}}" bindchange="onAccent"><view class="picker-value">{{accentOptions[accentIndex].label}}（点击切换）</view></picker><view class="muted" style="margin-top:10rpx;">切换后点「试听发音」即可对比。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">进度备份</view><view class="stat-line">已完成 {{totalChecked}} / 364 天 · 收藏 {{starredCount}} 个重点词 · 复习记录 {{reviewCount}} 个</view><view class="muted">卸载微信、换手机或清缓存都可能导致本机进度丢失。建议学习一段时间后导出一次，把备份保存到备忘录或文件中。</view><view class="btn-row" style="margin-top:16rpx;"><button class="btn-ghost btn-half" bindtap="onExport">导出备份</button><button class="btn-ghost btn-half" bindtap="onShowImport">导入恢复</button></view>
<block wx:if="{{showBackup}}"><view class="backup-box"><textarea class="backup-text" value="{{backupText}}" maxlength="-1" show-confirm-bar="{{false}}" auto-height="{{false}}" /></view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:10rpx;">内容已自动复制到剪贴板。若没复制上，可长按上方框内手动全选复制。</view><view class="btn-row" style="margin-top:10rpx;"><button class="btn-ghost btn-half" bindtap="onCopyBackup">重新复制</button><button class="btn-ghost btn-half btn-plain" bindtap="onHideBackup">收起</button></view></block>
<block wx:if="{{showImport}}"><view class="backup-box" style="margin-top:16rpx;"><textarea class="backup-text" placeholder="把之前导出的备份内容粘贴到这里" value="{{importText}}" bindinput="onImportInput" maxlength="-1" show-confirm-bar="{{false}}" /></view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:10rpx;">「合并」保留现有进度并补上备份缺失部分；「覆盖」以备份为准。本地现有进度会被替换。</view><button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onImportMerge" style="margin-top:10rpx;">合并导入</button><button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onImportReplace" style="margin-top:10rpx;">覆盖导入</button><button class="btn-ghost btn-plain" bindtap="onHideImport" style="margin-top:10rpx;">取消</button></block></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-label">关于</view><view class="about-btn" bindtap="onAbout">关于本计划 v{{appVersion}}</view></view>
